"e":132.575},{"w":"the","s":132.575,"e":132.735},{"w":"story","s":132.735,"e":133.055},{"w":"goes.","s":133.055,"e":133.615},{"w":"People","s":133.855,"e":134.175},{"w":"walked,","s":134.175,"e":134.895},{"w":"arrived,","s":134.975,"e":135.775},{"w":"and","s":135.775,"e":135.935},{"w":"their","s":135.935,"e":136.095},{"w":"bags","s":136.095,"e":136.495},{"w":"were","s":136.495,"e":136.735},{"w":"basically","s":136.735,"e":137.135},{"w":"waiting","s":137.135,"e":137.455},{"w":"for","s":137.455,"e":137.615},{"w":"them.","s":137.615,"e":137.775}]},{"speaker":"Sunnie","start":138.72,"end":145.52,"text":"So we don't actually hate waiting. We hate standing still with nothing to do.","words":[{"w":"So","s":138.84,"e":139.4},{"w":"we","s":139.4,"e":139.72},{"w":"don't","s":139.72,"e":140.12},{"w":"actually","s":140.12,"e":140.68},{"w":"hate","s":140.68,"e":141},{"w":"waiting.","s":141,"e":141.72},{"w":"We","s":142.04,"e":142.28},{"w":"hate","s":142.28,"e":142.6},{"w":"standing","s":142.6,"e":143.16},{"w":"still","s":143.16,"e":143.64},{"w":"with","s":143.64,"e":143.96},{"w":"nothing","s":143.96,"e":144.52},{"w":"to","s":144.52,"e":144.68},{"w":"do.","s":144.68,"e":145.16}]},{"speaker":"Desmond","start":145.82,"end":153.82,"text":"Exactly. Occupied time feels shorter than empty time. Walking gave people a way to kill time without realizing it.","words":[{"w":"Exactly.","s":146.04,"e":146.76},{"w":"Occupied","s":147.16,"e":147.72},{"w":"time","s":147.72,"e":148.04},{"w":"feels","s":148.04,"e":148.44},{"w":"shorter","s":148.44,"e":148.76},{"w":"than","s":148.76,"e":149},{"w":"empty","s":149,"e":149.32},{"w":"time.","s":149.32,"e":149.88},{"w":"Walking","s":150.12,"e":150.52},{"w":"gave","s":150.52,"e":150.84},{"w":"people","s":150.84,"e":151.08},{"w":"a","s":151.08,"e":151.24},{"w":"way","s":151.24,"e":151.4},{"w":"to","s":151.4,"e":151.56},{"w":"kill","s":151.56,"e":151.8},{"w":"time","s":151.8,"e":152.12},{"w":"without","s":152.12,"e":152.6},{"w":"realizing","s":152.6,"e":15